OL,3,GNEWSAFly-tippers to be fined five times
OL,4,Amore than before
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, there have been concerns
OL,7,Fraised over whether the increased fines
OL,8,Fwill be enough to put potential
OL,9,Ffly-tippers off, with some campaigners
OL,10,Fsaying making access to household waste
OL,11,Fsites easier might also help.
